    {
      "number": 2139,
      "text": "Say, “Call upon Allah or call upon the Most Compassionate[87] – whichever name you call, to Him belong the Most Beautiful Names.” Do not be too loud in your prayer, nor too quiet, but seek a way in between[88].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
